OL,3,AHigh-speed train crash kills at least
OL,4,A68 people in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA high-speed train crash has killed at
OL,7,Fleast 68 people and injured dozens more
OL,8,Fin central Spain.
OL,10,FIt occurred when a train travelling
OL,11,Ffrom Madrid to Seville barrelled into
OL,12,Fanother train - which was stationary on
OL,13,Fthe tracks - on Wednesday morning. The
OL,14,Fforce saw several carriages fall down
OL,15,Fan embankment.
OL,17,FThe transport minister said a computer
OL,18,Ffailure followed by human error caused
OL,19,Fthe crash, which is one of the worst in
OL,20,FEurope's modern history, and Spain's
OL,21,Fdeadliest train disaster in 13 years.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
