OL,3,AHigh-speed train crash kills at least
OL,4,A68 people in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurvivors described harrowing scenes of
OL,7,Fpassengers being thrown into the air,
OL,8,Ftrapped in the wreckage and smashing
OL,9,Fwindows to get out.
